        "data_preprocessing_details": "Label encoding for categorical features; min-max scaling; recursive feature elimination with Gradient Boosting for feature selection; train/test split 70/30; standardization for model inputs in supplementary data generation; synthetic cost-efficiency target constructed as weighted sum of cost features with noise.",
